    {
      "source": "hackernews",
      "subsource": "news.ycombinator.com",
      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Pirate Face Rescues LLM Models from Deletion",
      "url": "https://pirateface.co/",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49776699",
      "score": 482,
      "comments": 140,
      "author": "skepticalgenius",
      "published": "2026-09-20T15:16:07Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Archival initiatives mirror open-weight LLMs to prevent permanent loss from deletions, licensing disputes, and DMCA takedowns on Hugging Face.",
        "Centralized model hubs create single points of failure, driving community adoption of torrent-based and decentralized distribution for weights.",
        "ML engineering teams should implement self-hosted artifact registries and local weight mirrors rather than relying on upstream public repository availability."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
